nerally to less than 15 inches in height and generally spreads more in width than height. Turf grass is specifically excluded.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"a289ec0f-7e33-54ca-8822-55fd19303e56"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.235.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.235.020","content_hash":"8ce61006ede2610a2db32921afa4d8c919bdf63bb14d4f8732eacc5805c135a1","heading":null,"ordinal":8,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.020:block:8","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.235.020","text":"“Irrigation system” means a permanent underground piping and sprinkler head system designed using industry standard methods to provide uniform irrigation coverage over a landscaped area.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"49a17bd0-7311-5567-a1f4-81585444ce99"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.235.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.235.020","content_hash":"b802ee4efaed0f4e17d12b2d27f27d81968a92d9cceec4d8872ba2824d3fdf0c","heading":null,"ordinal":9,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.020:block:9","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.235.020","text":"“Landscaped area” means any area planted with groundcover, trees, shrubs, or other plant material that meets the provisions contained herein.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"8e8953e5-ba59-55e8-8f90-c189e9465d03"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.235.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.235.020","content_hash":"6d793f260a75c9ae2a7e8dc193610bf73df6e93fe417ce9a845fb10211aed8d0","heading":null,"ordinal":10,"parent_source_component_key":"ks